    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM8AAAABBlHmMg",
      "title": "Add Unichain Sepolia PAO transition tasks (sep/107-108)",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1533,
      "body": "Sepolia half of the Unichain PAO transfer. Both tasks are DRAFT since they are a reference for Unichain to execute the transfers on their end: \r\n\r\n- **sep/107** transfers the L1 `ProxyAdmin` and `DisputeGameFactory` from the Unichain Sepolia Safe to the standard Sepolia L1PAO (`TransferOwners`)\r\n- **sep/108** transfers the L2 `ProxyAdmin` predeploy to the aliased L1PAO via a portal deposit sent by the same Safe (`TransferL2PAOFromL1`)\r\n\r\n\r\n| Contract | Owner before | Owner after |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| `ProxyAdmin` `0x2BF403E5353A7a082ef6bb3Ae2Be3B866D8D3ea4` | `0xd363339eE47775888Df411A163c586a8BdEA9dbf` (Unichain Sepolia Safe) | `0x1Eb2fFc903729a0F03966B917003800b145F56E2` (Sepolia L1PAO) |\r\n| `DisputeGameFactoryProxy` `0xeff73e5aa3B9AEC32c659Aa3E00444d20a84394b` | `0xd363339eE47775888Df411A163c586a8BdEA9dbf` (Unichain Sepolia Safe) | `0x1Eb2fFc903729a0F03966B917003800b145F56E2` (Sepolia L1PAO) |\r\n| L2 `ProxyAdmin` `0x4200000000000000000000000000000000000018` | `0xe474339ee47775888df411A163c586a8bDEaaEd0` (aliased Safe) | `0x2FC3ffc903729a0f03966b917003800B145F67F3` (aliased L1PAO) |\r\n\r\nOther roles addresses on Unichain Sepolia are already standard/out of scope: Guardian and SuperchainConfig are the OP Sepolia ones, DelayedWETH is post-U16 and not ownable and the Challenger and SystemConfig owner are Unichain-operated Safes that stay with the operator.\r\n\r\nMainnet transfer: #1527 ",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
